<report>
<line><title>Odds ratio meta-analysis</title></line>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><thfirst>Table (exposed +ve, control +ve, exposed -ve, control -ve)</thfirst><thspan/><thspan/><thspan/><thspan/></tr>
<block name="inputs"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>a</in></td><td><in>b</in></td><td><in>c</in></td><td><in>d</in></td><td><subtotal><in>lb</in></subtotal></td></tr></block>
</table>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Odds ratio</th><thfirst><ci><in>pc</in>% CI (<in>method</in>)</ci></thfirst><thspan/><thspan/></tr>
<block name="or"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><inu>or</inu></td><td><ci><inu>lci</inu></ci></td><td><ci><inu>uci</inu></ci></td><td><ci><subtotal><in>lb</in></subtotal></ci></td></tr></block>
</table>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><thfirst>% Weights (fixed, random)</thfirst><thspan/><thspan/></tr>
<block name="or"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><inu>yi</inu></td><td><inu>vi</inu></td><td><inu>wt</inu></td><td><inu>dwt</inu></td><td><subtotal><in>lb</in></subtotal></td></tr></block>
</table>
<line></line>
<line><u>Fixed effects (Mantel-Haenszel, <in>meth</in>)</u></line>
<line>Pooled odds ratio = <inu>odds</inu> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from</inu> to <inu>to</inu></ci>)</line>
<line>Chi<sub>2</sub> (test odds ratio differs from 1) = <inu>chi_mantel</inu>  <pval><inp>chi_p</inp></pval></line>
<line></line>
<block name="cml">
<line><u>Fixed effects (conditional maximum likelihood)</u></line>
<line>Pooled odds ratio = <inu>eor</inu></line>
<line><ci>Exact Fisher <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>llf</inu> to <inu>ulf</inu></ci></line>
<line><pval>Exact Fisher one sided <inp>p1f</inp>, two sided <inp>p2f</inp></pval></line>
<line><ci>Exact mid-P <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>llm</inu> to <inu>ulm</inu></ci></line>
<line><pval>Exact mid-P one sided <inp>p1m</inp>, two sided <inp>p2m</inp></pval></line>
<line></line>
</block>
<line><u>Non-combinability of studies</u></line>
<line>Breslow-Day = <inu>bd</inu>  (df = <in>df</in>)  <pval><inp>xp</inp></pval></line>
<line>Cochran Q = <inu>qc</inu>  (df = <in>df_cochran</in>)  <pval><inp>xp_cochran</inp></pval></line>
<line>Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = <inu>tausq</inu></line>
<line>I<sub>2</sub> (inconsistency) = <in>isq</in>% (<ci><in>pc1</in>% CI = <in>llisq</in>% to <in>ulisq</in>%</ci>) </line>
<line></line>
<line><u>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</u></line>
<line>Pooled odds ratio = <inu>dsor</inu> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>dsll</inu> to <inu>dsul</inu></ci>)</line>
<line>Chi<sub>2</sub> (test odds ratio differs from 1) = <inu>dsx2</inu>  (df = <in>df_ds</in>)  <pval><inp>xp_ds</inp></pval></line>
<line></line>
<block name="egger">
<line><u>Bias indicators</u></line>
<line>Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's <in>tau</in>  <pval><in>p2</in></pval></line>
<line>Egger: bias = <in>a</in> (<ci><in>pc_egger</in>% CI = <in>cl</in> to <in>cu</in></ci>)  <pval><in>p</in></pval></line>
</block>
<block name="harbord">
<line>Harbord-Egger: bias = <in>a</in> (<ci><in>pc_harbord</in>% CI = <in>cl</in> to <in>cu</in></ci>)  <pval><in>p</in></pval></line>
</block>
</report>
